### Authenticate through the admin panel, then supply your session and CSRF token.
@origin = http://localhost:3000
@workspace = replace-with-workspace-uuid
@session = replace-with-session-cookie
@csrf = replace-with-csrf-token
@source = https://github.com/owner/repository/tree/main/skills

### Discover SKILL.md packages and linked Markdown/text guides at one source commit.
# Connected private repositories use the GitHub App. Candidates retain YAML metadata
# and descriptions up to 1,024 characters. Inspect spec.frontmatter, spec.resources
# and error before selecting. Missing/oversized guides make a candidate unavailable.
POST {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/skills/github/discover
Origin: {{origin}}
Cookie: repodesk_session={{session}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"url":"{{source}}"}

### Copy commit and paths from discovery; imports create disabled unpublished drafts.
POST {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/skills/github/import
Origin: {{origin}}
Cookie: repodesk_session={{session}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"url":"{{source}}","commit":"replace-with-discovered-40-character-sha","paths":["skills/recap/SKILL.md","skills/review/SKILL.md"]}

### Review an imported skill's tracked source and guide-only changes using its current revision.
@skill = replace-with-skill-uuid
POST {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/skills/{{skill}}/github/check
Origin: {{origin}}
Cookie: repodesk_session={{session}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":1}

### Save a reviewed update. Set replaceLocal true only after reviewing local edits.
POST {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/skills/{{skill}}/github/update
Origin: {{origin}}
Cookie: repodesk_session={{session}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":1,"commit":"replace-with-previewed-40-character-sha","replaceLocal":false}
